,p_attribute_sequence=>8
,p_display_sequence=>80
,p_static_id=>'debug_config'
,p_prompt=>'Debug Config'
,p_attribute_type=>'PLSQL FUNCTION BODY'
,p_is_required=>false
,p_default_value=>wwv_flow_string.join(wwv_flow_t_varchar2(
'return q''!{',
'  "show_reasoning": true,',
'  "show_tools": true,',
'  "show_metadata": true',
'}!'';'))
,p_is_translatable=>false
,p_attribute_group_id=>wwv_flow_imp.id(479229138042456090)
,p_examples=>wwv_flow_string.join(wwv_flow_t_varchar2(
unistr('<p><strong>Static example \2013 everything on:</strong></p>'),
'',
'<pre>return q''!{',
'  "show_reasoning": true,',
'  "show_tools": true,',
'  "show_metadata": true,',
'  "show_debug": true',
'}!'';',
'</pre>',
'',
unistr('<p><strong>Conditional example \2013 admins only:</strong></p>'),
'<pre>if apex_authorization.is_authorized(''ADMIN_AUTH'') or apex_application.g_edit_cookie_session_id is not null then',
'  return ''{ "show_reasoning": true, "show_tools": true, "show_metadata": true, "show_debug": true }'';',
'else',
'  return ''{}'';',
'end if;</pre>'))
,p_help_text=>wwv_flow_string.join(wwv_flow_t_varchar2(
'<p>Optional. A <strong>PL/SQL function body</strong> that returns a JSON string controlling which debug sections are visible to the end user. All three flags default to <code>false</code> (hidden) when this attribute is empty, the function raises an '
||'error, or the JSON is invalid.</p>',
'<p>The JSON object recognizes three boolean keys:</p>',
'<ul>',
unistr('  <li><code>show_reasoning</code> \2013 show the assistant''s internal reasoning / chain-of-thought as a collapsible block above each answer.</li>'),
unistr('  <li><code>show_tools</code> \2013 show each tool call the agent makes (tool name, arguments, result, status).</li>'),
unistr('  <li><code>show_metadata</code> \2013 show token usage (input / output tokens) next to each assistant message.</li>'),
unistr('  <li><code>show_debug</code> \2013 show debug panel with advanced details.</li>'),
'</ul>',
'<p>Because this is a PL/SQL function, you can return different configurations based on session state &mdash; e.g. show debug only to admins.</p>',
'<p><strong>Server-side filtering:</strong> when a flag is <code>false</code>, the corresponding rows/fields are removed from the AJAX response on the server. Hidden content never reaches the browser, so a tampered client cannot reveal it.</p>'))
);
